{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the\u00a0<i>Spaceship Down</i> demo, you play as Noah, a junior technician stranded aboard the derelict ship<i> Clementine.</i> You have a slice of the ship to explore, puzzles to solve, and you begin uncovering some evidence of what it was like aboard the<i> Clementine</i>\u00a0before it crashed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Spaceship Down demo  is designed to showcase the narrative style gameplay, humour, and art style of the larger game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For more details on the full version of Spaceship Down, see the main game page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u00a0</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771820?t=1748996365","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771820/5376ae2b8e3fe0af105e006a4c52008d61820940/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748996365","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771820/735237370977c29fabdf79c23165d3b3b65330d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748996365","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771820/735237370977c29fabdf79c23165d3b3b65330d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748996365","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the\u00a0<i>Spaceship Down</i> demo, you play as Noah, a junior technician stranded aboard the derelict ship<i> Clementine.</i> You have a slice of the ship to explore, puzzles to solve, and you begin uncovering some evidence of what it was like aboard the<i> Clementine</i>\u00a0before it crashed.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Spaceship Down demo  is designed to showcase the narrative style gameplay, humour, and art style of the larger game.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For more details on the full version of Spaceship Dow